+# Invoice review service
+
+## Purpose
+
+This project reviews invoice line items for duplicate references and arithmetic mismatches and returns findings for a human finance operator.
+
+## Current implementation
+
+The TypeScript source defines invoice lines by reference and amount in cents. It implements duplicate-reference detection, returning the sorted unique references that occur more than once. The current source does not establish arithmetic-mismatch detection behavior.
+
+## Users and boundaries
+
+The findings are for a human finance operator. The service never authorizes or sends a payment.
